{
  "name": "skills-extension-watch-symlink",
  "about": "被监视的扩展路径本身是符号链接时的热更新（ExtensionWatchManager.ts:109-131、170-188）。第一次起服务时 <pilotHome>/skills 还不存在，基线从最近的已存在祖先递归监视；这一轮用 bash 把 skills 建成指向 home/elsewhere/gskills 的链接、在 gskills 里再建一个指向 home/elsewhere/inner 的子目录链接、把 alpha 项目的 .pilotdeck/skills 建成指向 home/elsewhere/pskills 的链接（链接本身出现会被报告一次）。重启后这些路径在监视开始时已存在：基线的 fs.watch 直接监视链接（macOS 上实测会跟到链接背后的目录），于是往 gskills 里写技能打 Extensions changed（全局），往 pskills 里写打项目那一行，之后的轮次看到新技能；往树内子目录链接背后（inner）写不报告。第一次起服务期间，链接建好之后往 gskills 写也不报告（祖先监视不跟链接）。Linux 上（cb8 实测）不同：Node 22 在 Linux 上没有原生递归监视，逐个条目各挂一个 inotify（internal/fs/recursive_watch.js），树内的链接也被跟到目标及其直接子项一层，于是第一次起服务期间往 gskills 建 early-global 目录、第二次往 inner 写 SKILL.md 都各多报告一次全局的 Extensions changed。",
  "server": false,
  "files": {
    "home/.pilotdeck/projects/private-tmp-pdrs-bbx-root-home-work-alpha/.cwd": "{HOME}/work/alpha\n",
    "home/work/alpha/README.md": "alpha\n",
    "home/elsewhere/gskills/old-global/SKILL.md": "---\nname: old-global\ndescription: A user skill behind the link.\n---\n\n# old-global\n",
    "home/elsewhere/inner/README.md": "inner\n",
    "home/elsewhere/pskills/README.md": "pskills\n"
  },
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\": \"Link run\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "setup-after",
      "when": [
        "setup links:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_setup_0\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Linked."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "setup",
      "when": [
        "setup links:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_setup_0",
          "name": "bash",
          "arguments": {
            "command": "ln -s {HOME}/elsewhere/gskills {HOME}/.pilotdeck/skills && ln -s {HOME}/elsewhere/inner {HOME}/elsewhere/gskills/linked && mkdir -p {HOME}/work/alpha/.pilotdeck && ln -s {HOME}/elsewhere/pskills {HOME}/work/alpha/.pilotdeck/skills && echo done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "early-after",
      "when": [
        "write early:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_early_0\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Wrote early."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "early",
      "when": [
        "write early:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_early_0",
          "name": "write_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "{HOME}/elsewhere/gskills/early-global/SKILL.md",
            "content": "---\nname: early-global\ndescription: Written behind the link before the restart.\n---\n\n# early-global\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "inner-after",
      "when": [
        "write inner:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_inner_0\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Wrote inner."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "inner",
      "when": [
        "write inner:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_inner_0",
          "name": "write_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "{HOME}/elsewhere/inner/SKILL.md",
            "content": "---\nname: inner-skill\ndescription: Behind an inner link.\n---\n\n# inner-skill\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "global-after",
      "when": [
        "write global:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_global_0\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Wrote global."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "global",
      "when": [
        "write global:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_global_0",
          "name": "write_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "{HOME}/elsewhere/gskills/fresh-global/SKILL.md",
            "content": "---\nname: fresh-global\ndescription: Written behind the linked skills root.\n---\n\n# fresh-global\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "project-after",
      "when": [
        "write project:",
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_project_0\""
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Wrote project."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "project",
      "when": [
        "write project:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_project_0",
          "name": "write_file",
          "arguments": {
            "file_path": "{HOME}/elsewhere/pskills/fresh-alpha/SKILL.md",
            "content": "---\nname: fresh-alpha\ndescription: Written behind the linked project skills root.\n---\n\n# fresh-alpha\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "main",
      "reply": {
        "text": "ok"
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "serve": [
        "server"
      ],
      "timeout": 90000,
      "then": [
